"after": " instantânea.</p></div></div>\n<figure class=\"approved-figure\" aria-label=\"Distinção entre sistema, método, arte e regra na ordenação jurídica\" data-src=\"aula-09.html#c4\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:28px auto 32px;padding:18px clamp(14px,3vw,28px);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--grid-major);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">\n<figcaption style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--ink-2);font:500 12px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase\">Termos e operações da ordenação jurídica</figcaption>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;color:var(--ink);font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans)\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Termo</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Sentido descrito</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Papel na ordenação</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Sistema · amplo</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Ordenação do material jurídico por critério compreensivo.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Organiza materiais sem exigir dedução de axiomas.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Sistema · estrito</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Proposições particulares decorrem logicamente de axiomas fundamentais.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Conecta princípios e conclusões por dedução.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Método</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Modo ordenado de dizer ou fazer; encadeia verdades para descobrir ou comunicar outras.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Dispõe o raciocínio conforme a tarefa.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Arte</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Faculdade que prescreve regras para fazer algo corretamente.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Orienta práticas e aparece em manuais jurídicos e de governo.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Regra</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Princípio geral ou disposição estável, tendente a cobrir uma classe de situações.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Pode apoiar o raciocínio sem comandar toda a estrutura casuística.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></figure><section class=\"chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"c6\"><span class=\"num conc\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</span><h2 id=\"c6\">Teste"
